            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Cardiac rehabilitation for life-time in a patient who has suffered coronary pathology is considered as appropriate. The reasons for such an opinion are given, as well as the two most indicated courses of action, being this rehabilitation at home and coronary clubs.</AbstractText>
